lity** that has received many **positive reviews (4.9/5.0)**.\n\nWhether you're a fan or not, why not **give it a try**? It's **free to try**!\n\n**What's in it for you**?\n\nYou can play the **first few levels** of each game.\nIf you **like a game**, **buy it**.\nIf not, **try another**!\n\nOh the **good news** is if you buy **4 games**, you unlock **all current and upcoming games**!\n\nArcade is **actively maintained** to offer **new content** on a regular basis.\n\nCheers\nNeoPunk\n{1664587954091672}", "short_description": "Arcade is a collection of 14 retro-style games in mixed reality that has received many positive reviews (4.9/5.0).\n\nWhether you're a fan or not, why not give it a try? It's free to try!\n\nWhat's in it for you?\nYou can play the first few levels of each game.\nIf you like a game, buy it.\nIf not, try another!\n\nOh the good news is if you buy 4 games, you unlock all current and upcoming games!\n\nArcade is actively maintained to offer new content on a regular basis.\n\nCheers\nNeoPunk"}]}, "developer_name": "NeoPunk", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.neopunk.xyz/policy.php", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "NeoPunk", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.neopunk.xyz/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_US